#etcsl: line-id=A.25

A.26. ku₆ im-dab₅ nunuz im-degₓ(RI)-degₓ(RI)-ge zag im-ma-ni-in-tag
#lem: kud[fish]; dab[seize]; nunuz[egg]; deg[gather up]; zag[side]; tag[touch]
#tr.en: It catches fish; it collects eggs and crushes them. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.26

