#lem: eštub[carp]; gizi[fresh reed]; didila[small(er)]; zag[side]; tag[touch]
#tr.en: It crushes the @fsux{eštub} carp in the little @fsux{zi} reeds. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.28

A.29. kiŋ₂-tur-e {u₂}li-gi₄-li-gi₄-a zag im-ma-ni-in-tag
